WEBVTT

00:43:59.678 --> 00:44:04.072
But I would say most of my friends
are all Never Trumpers.

00:44:04.096 --> 00:44:07.848
And I think we shared a certain ethos
of what conservatism meant.

00:44:07.872 --> 00:44:11.382
One of them, by the way,
was that politics is a limited activity,

00:44:11.406 --> 00:44:15.879
that what really matters is character
and relationships and things like that.

00:44:15.903 --> 00:44:19.542
And so it was beyond the pale for us
to get involved with a guy like Trump

00:44:19.566 --> 00:44:22.482
who violates every moral norm
you can think of.

00:44:22.506 --> 00:44:23.689
And second, frankly --

00:44:23.713 --> 00:44:26.807
and I'm not sure those on the left
will want to hear this, but --

00:44:26.831 --> 00:44:29.040
I spend a lot of time
in conservative circles,

00:44:29.064 --> 00:44:32.894
but I live in New York and DC, and so
I spend a lot of time in liberal circles.